description:
Susun output sebelum dan setelah dua elemen array diubah.

```java
public class TraceArrayUpdate {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] values = {2, 5, 8};
        System.out.println(values[0]);
        values[0] += 4;
        System.out.println(values[0]);
        values[2] = values[0] + 1;
        System.out.println(values[2]);
    }
}
```
